      "block_id": "2605.06070_p5_b14",
      "text": "Our goal is to estimate the absolute quality gap between two images in each dataset instance\nbased on the available information, without relying on a reward model. Specifically, the available\ninformation includes: (i) the source models\u2019 capability distributions extracted by Arena, parameterized\nas \u03b8w \u223cN(\u00b5w, (\u03c3w)2) and \u03b8l \u223cN(\u00b5l, (\u03c3l)2), and (ii) a human-annotated binary preference label\nxw\n",
