    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p5_b16",
      "text": "Problem 1 (Arena-based Image Quality Gap Estimation). Consider two models whose capability\ndistributions are \u03b8w \u223cN(\u00b5w, (\u03c3w)2) and \u03b8l \u223cN(\u00b5l, (\u03c3l)2). Let Qw and Ql be the output qualities\nobtained by drawing once from \u03b8w and \u03b8l, respectively. Given the observed event Qw > Ql, calculate\nthe posterior expectation of the quality gap E[Qw \u2212Ql | Qw > Ql].\n",
      "bbox": [
